# Mobile

## Status (locked)

- **Target:** Expo (React Native) — roadmap `rn-expo-scaffold`, then feature
  ports. Carpool **push** (`push-notifications`) is a pre-beta gate and needs
  Expo (or equivalent) device registration.
- **KMP under `mobile/` is frozen.** No new product UI, no new OpenAPI client
  surface in `sharedLogic`. Contract changes update **web** (and Expo when it
  exists) only — see `AGENTS.md`. Removal: `kmp-mobile-retire`.

## Legacy KMP (touch only if unavoidable)

- Shared networking lived in `mobile/sharedLogic`, consumed by
  `mobile/androidApp` (Compose) and `mobile/iosApp` (SwiftUI).
- Mobile and backend are **two Gradle builds** — shared only via
  `contracts/openapi.yaml`.
- Tests (from `mobile/`), if you must run them:
  `./gradlew :sharedLogic:testAndroidHostTest :androidApp:assembleDebug`
- Token outputs (`UiTokens.kt`, `UiTokens.swift`) are generated from
  `design-tokens/tokens.json` — do not edit them by hand.
